# Recorded input for the button page (widgets/button.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 80 in the default
# theme: Reset at x 12..70 and Apply at 78..136, both on y 12..46. One line per frame below
# (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40, Space 44.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 80
dt 0.016
pointer 300 70
# 1: hover Reset
frame
pointer 41 29
# 2: hold it (it takes focus)
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: a click
frame
buttons
# 4: Enter: Reset fires again
frame
pointer 300 70
press 40
# 5: Space down: nothing yet
frame
press 44
# 6: Space up: Reset fires
frame
release 44
# 7: press Apply, drag off it, release: no click, and Apply keeps focus
frame
pointer 107 29
buttons left
# 8: dragged off, still held
frame
pointer 200 70
# 9: released off it: no click
frame
buttons
# 10: Enter: Apply fires
frame
press 40
# 11: a press on the panel takes focus away; Enter does nothing
frame
buttons left
press 40
